# Development and test dependencies. Never installed into the published image.
#
# A constraint, not a requirement: the two files are compiled separately, so
# `-r` would let a shared dependency resolve to one version here and another
# there. `-c` pins development to whatever the runtime already settled on.
-c requirements.txt
-r requirements.in

